@{
    Layout = null;
}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Privacy Policy - Client Portal &amp; Deposit Tracker</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/lib/bootstrap/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/site.css" asp-append-version="true" />
</head>
<body class="app-shell-body py-5 px-3">
    <div class="container" style="max-width: 760px;">
        <div class="mb-3">
            <a asp-controller="Account" asp-action="Register" class="figma-link small">&larr; Back to Register</a>
        </div>

        <div class="hifi-card p-4 p-md-5">
            <h1 class="h3 fw-bold mb-1">Privacy Policy (POPIA)</h1>
            <p class="text-muted small mb-4">Last updated: November 2026 &middot; Protection of Personal Information Act (POPIA)</p>

            <h2 class="h6 fw-bold mt-4">1. Information We Collect</h2>
            <ul class="small text-muted">
                <li><strong>Freelancer Account Data:</strong> Full name, business name, email address, contact phone number, logo URL, and EFT banking details.</li>
                <li><strong>Client &amp; Project Data:</strong> Client name, client email address, project scope, milestone progress, and payment status.</li>
                <li><strong>Audit &amp; Payment Records:</strong> E-signature audit logs (signer name, IP address, user agent, timestamp) and uploaded Proof of Payment (POP) documents.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2 class="h6 fw-bold mt-4">2. How We Use &amp; Protect Your Data</h2>
            <p class="small text-muted">
                Data is used strictly to operate client portals, verify payments, and maintain legal quote audit trails. All database records are isolated per freelancer using Row-Level Security (RLS), and uploaded Proof of Payment files are stored in encrypted private storage buckets accessible only via short-lived signed URLs.
            </p>

            <h2 class="h6 fw-bold mt-4">3. Third-Party Processors</h2>
            <p class="small text-muted mb-0">
                We rely on Supabase for authenticated database and file storage and Paystack for PCI-DSS compliant card payment processing. We never sell or rent personal data to third parties.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
